        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n model: $('Config').first().json.ollamaModel,\n  prompt: `Write a short, non-salesy cold outreach email in German (formal 'Sie') from ${$('Parse Score').first().json.senderName} of ${$('Parse Score').first().json.senderCompany}, a solo IT automation and AI consultancy, to the company below. Reference something specific and plausible about their business (industry, likely manual processes) based on this context. Keep it under 120 words, one clear call to action (15-minute call), no hype language, no exclamation marks.\\n\\nCompany: ${$('Parse Score').first().json.name}\\nContext: ${$('Parse Score').first().json.reasoning}\\n\\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON: {\"subject\": \"<subject line>\", \"body\": \"<email body>\"}`,\n  format: 'json',\n  stream: false\n}) }}",
